{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\TravelManager\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/BackupService.php:117",
        "lib/Service/BookingService.php:71",
        "lib/Service/BookingService.php:358",
        "lib/Service/MaintenanceService.php:36"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "4 transactions are opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Service/BackupService.php:117",
        "  lib/Service/BookingService.php:71",
        "  lib/Service/BookingService.php:358",
        "  lib/Service/MaintenanceService.php:36"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 4,
          "count": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "job-time-sensitivity",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/BackgroundJob/DispatcherJob.php OCA\\TravelManager\\BackgroundJob\\DispatcherJob"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 timed job does not say whether it is time sensitive. A job that sets TIME_INSENSITIVE with setTimeSensitivity() is moved to the maintenance window of the server; whether a job is heavy enough for that only its maintainer knows.",
        "  lib/BackgroundJob/DispatcherJob.php OCA\\TravelManager\\BackgroundJob\\DispatcherJob"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config-without-lexicon",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Llm/TaskProcessingLlmService.php:107 getValueString()",
        "lib/Service/ConfigService.php:100 getValueBool()",
