        "lib/Service/ConfigService.php:142 setValueBool()",
        "lib/Service/ConfigService.php:147 getValueBool()",
        "lib/Service/ConfigService.php:151 setValueBool()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The app reads and writes its app config in 13 places and registers no config lexicon, which IRegistrationContext::registerConfigLexicon() takes since Nextcloud 31. A lexicon states the type, the default and the sensitivity of each key in one place.",
        "  lib/Llm/TaskProcessingLlmService.php:107 getValueString()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:100 getValueBool()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:104 setValueBool()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:109 getValueInt()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:113 setValueInt()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:118 getValueInt()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:124 setValueInt()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:129 getValueInt()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:133 setValueInt()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:138 getValueBool()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:142 setValueBool()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:147 getValueBool()",
        "  lib/Service/ConfigService.php:151 setValueBool()"
      ],
